row(3, 24, 'MATERIAL', f'O LORD GOD, YOU HAVE BEGUN TO SHOW YOUR SERVANT YOUR GREATNESS AND YOUR STRONG HAND — WHAT GOD IN HEAVEN OR EARTH CAN DO ACCORDING TO YOUR WORKS AND MIGHTY ACTS? {HP(3, 24, (("אדני", "יהוה"), "O LORD GOD — the Torah\'s four seats: ABRAHAM\'S TWO (Genesis 15:2, 8) and Moses\' two (3:24, 9:26); 284 in the Bible (computed)"), (("אתה", "החלות", "להראות", "את", "עבדך"), "YOU HAVE BEGUN to show your servant (computed)"), (("את", "גדלך", "ואת", "ידך", "החזקה"), "YOUR GREATNESS AND YOUR STRONG HAND — \'your greatness\' 3:24 and Joshua 3:7; \'your strong hand\' 3:24 and SOLOMON\'S PRAYER (1 Kings 8:42) (computed)"), (("אשר", "מי", "אל", "בשמים", "ובארץ"), "what god in heaven or on earth (computed)"), (("כמעשיך", "וכגבורתך"), "according to your works and your mighty acts — a hapax pair (computed)"))} → {AP(3, 24, (("יי", "אלהים", "את", "שריתא", "לאחזאה"), "O LORD GOD, you have begun to show — \'you have begun\' one seat (computed)"), (("אלהא", "דשכנתך", "בשמיא", "מלעלא", "ושליט", "בארעא"), "GOD WHOSE SHEKHINAH IS IN THE HEAVENS ABOVE AND WHO RULES ON THE EARTH — the rhetorical question made a confession; \'whose Shekhinah\' one seat, \'and rules\' 3:24 and 4:39 (computed)"))} The Sifrei 26:10, 27: the two names as mercy and judgment; \'you began\' — you released my vow to Jethro, you opened the door at the calf; the servants; the ten plagues; no deputy to fear.')
